  "description": "Kang Tae-seo drifts from one part-time job to another to pay off the debt his father left behind.   \nTrapped in the swamp of poverty slowly engulfing him, Tae-seo thinks of a man. The son of South Korea's most successful chaebol family.    \nAnd Lee Seo-hyun, his first love from high school.\n\nOne day, while living with the sole consolation that his younger sister Min-seo—who was smarter than him—was doing well in college,    \nTae-seo felt hopeless upon receiving a notice from a loan shark that they would raise interest rates. He sends a text message to a number that might no longer exist.\n\n[Lend me some money.]\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078474)",
